**蓝牙 ViewModel**：`C:\Users\Admin\Desktop\code0911\AutoSettings\app\src\main\java\com\flyme\auto\settings\function\connection\bluetooth\BlueToothViewModel.java`

在构造函数里注册 `BroadcastReceiver`，在 `onCleared()` 里反注册 —— 这是 ViewModel 生命周期的典型用法：

```
public class BlueToothViewModel extends BaseViewModel {

    public MutableLiveData<Boolean> mBluetooth = new MutableLiveData<>(false);

    private final BluetoothListenerReceiver mReceiver = new BluetoothListenerReceiver();

    public BlueToothViewModel() {

        super();

        initBluetoothStatus();

        registerBlueToothChangeReceiver();   // 构造时注册

    }

    private void registerBlueToothChangeReceiver() {

        SettingsApplication.getContext().registerReceiver(mReceiver, getBtChangeFilter());

    }

    @Override

    protected void onCleared() {

        super.onCleared();

        unregisterBlueToothChangeReceiver();  // ViewModel 销毁时反注册

    }

    private class BluetoothListenerReceiver extends BroadcastReceiver {

        @Override

        public void onReceive(Context context, Intent intent) {

            int state = intent.getIntExtra(BluetoothAdapter.EXTRA_STATE, 0);

            mBluetooth.setValue(state == BluetoothAdapter.STATE_ON);

        }

    }

}
```

行为描述：ViewModel 构造时注册系统广播，`onCleared()` 反注册。屏幕旋转时 ViewModel 不重建（存活在 `ViewModelStore`），广播不会重复注册；Activity 真正 finish 时 `onCleared()` 触发，广播被释放。

